{
  "name": "P8.policy-irpm-connector-snapshot",
  "description": "Connector-sourced IRPM (Brief 62.6): a live API Lab connector net (-10%) re-derived from its FROZEN snapshot (no network) — capped ±25% (not binding); applied to a 1000 subtotal -> 900; $500 floor not binding. The engine stays SOURCE-BLIND — the connector net flows through the identical schedule_rating path as a literal/column/model net, carrying connector provenance (source/connector/version/snapshot_id/cost_usd) into the trace. Re-running reads the snapshot, never the live API — replay determinism.",
  "policy": {
